[node name="help" type="Label" parent="Help" unique_id=1382533284]
offset_right = 918.0
offset_bottom = 465.0
text = "Moving across screens

Press the diffrent buttons to move across splash screens.

Goals:
Try to get to the wormhole to teleport to another galaxy and avoid black holes where you can get stuck in time forever.

Playing with human
To play with the human, press right and left arrow keys to move right and left and up arrow keys to jump.

How to play with ai
First train your ai so it has a goal, then click \"play ai\" to simulate the ai playing.

Players and Ai's
if you or the ai gets to the wormhole then they win, scoring is based on how fast you get to the wormhole.


"

